  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), the `rest_api.php` flag buckets answered to a **logged-in** session. `R57a`–`R57c` cover the anonymous categories and topics only, so LOT-057 cannot ship its flag buckets without this.\n\n### Scope\n\n- `topics/participated`, `topics/read` and `topics/favorites`, logged in, as read-only GETs, with at least one topic in each bucket.\n- If HFR serves it, a page 2 or a `results_per_page` answer for one bucket.\n- Take the exact URLs from the LOT-057 spec and HFR-PROTOCOL (REST rows), and never guess them.\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field: topic titles of members, pseudos and ids, per FIXTURES.md. Never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36). One PR per batch of captures.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-057 (#83, REST browsing client), and through it LOT-168 (#286). See also #285 (REST sub-forum lists).\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\nLOT-057 issue body (steward rewrite, 2026-10-29). Restart plan on #166.",
